nd medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) and startups in Korea.</p><p style=\"word-break: keep-all; text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; max-height: 999999px; padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"Noto Light\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\">We encourage active participation to ensure&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"word-break: keep-all; text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; max-height: 999999px;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"Noto Light\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><b>foreign students' successful pre-registration of resumes</b> </span></font><b style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto medium&quot;; font-size: 17px;\">on the platform.</b></span></p><p style=\"word-break: keep-all; text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; max-height: 999999px; padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"word-break: keep-all; text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; max-height: 999999px;\"><b style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto medium&quot;; font-size: 17px;\"></b><br></span></p><p style=\"word-break: keep-all; text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; max-height: 999999px; padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHoEYUg1AHvAQgRwDLwCYCkA2AggFYC2KAXgJ4D2AbgCIDKAdMQA4DmQA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p style=\"word-break: keep-all; text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; max-height: 999999px; padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"word-break: keep-all; text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; max-height: 999999px;\"><b style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto medium&quot;; font-size: 17px;\"><br></b></span></p><p style=\"word-break: keep-all; text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; max-height: 999999px; p